---
// A gate in plain code between what agents propose and what reaches the exchange, plus the monitor and stop button behind it.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900, H = 430;
---
<figure class="p22q">
  <div class="p22q-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Agents propose orders. A risk gate written as plain code checks size, notional cap, loss so far and price band, then passes or rejects. Passed orders go to execution and the exchange. A monitor compares orders out with orders in and loss so far. It feeds a stop button, held by a person or a rule, that closes the gate.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Agents propose, a gate in plain code decides what leaves the building</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Agent đề xuất, một cổng viết bằng code thường quyết định cái gì được ra ngoài</tspan></text>

      <rect x="20" y="70" width="170" height="70" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={50} y={105} size={26} />
      <text x="74" y="100" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Agents</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Agent</tspan></text>
      <text x="74" y="119" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>propose orders</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đề xuất lệnh</tspan></text>
      <line x1="190" x2="262" y1="105" y2="105" class="ln flow" />
      <polygon points="262,99 274,105 262,111" class="arr" />

      <rect x="278" y="64" width="250" height="82" rx="6" class="box gate" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={310} y={105} size={28} />
      <text x="338" y="98" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Risk gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổng rủi ro</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="117" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>code, not a model</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>là code, không phải mô hình</tspan></text>
      <line x1="528" x2="590" y1="105" y2="105" class="ln flow" />
      <polygon points="590,99 602,105 590,111" class="arr" />

      <rect x="606" y="70" width="130" height="70" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x={634} y={105} size={24} />
      <text x="656" y="110" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Execution</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thực thi</tspan></text>
      <line x1="736" x2="770" y1="105" y2="105" class="ln flow" />
      <polygon points="770,99 782,105 770,111" class="arr" />
      <rect x="786" y="70" width="94" height="70" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={833} y={92} size={22} />
      <text x="833" y="125" text-anchor="middle" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>Exchange</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sàn</tspan></text>

      <g class="checks">
        <text x="20" y="166" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Inside the gate, in order</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên trong cổng, theo thứ tự</tspan></text>
        <text x="20" y="188" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>1  order size under the limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1  cỡ lệnh dưới hạn mức</tspan></text>
        <text x="20" y="208" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>2  total notional under the cap</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2  tổng giá trị dưới trần</tspan></text>
        <text x="20" y="228" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>3  loss today under the daily limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3  lỗ trong ngày dưới hạn mức</tspan></text>
        <text x="20" y="248" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>4  price inside the exchange band (±7% on HOSE)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4  giá trong biên độ sàn (±7% trên HOSE)</tspan></text>
        <text x="690" y="172" class="n red-t"><tspan data-lang-en>fails any check: reject</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trượt một bước: từ chối</tspan></text>
        <text x="690" y="190" class="n red-t"><tspan data-lang-en>and write it to the log</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và ghi vào log</tspan></text>
      </g>
      
      <rect x="606" y="290" width="274" height="74" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="eye" x={636} y={327} size={26} />
      <text x="662" y="318" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Monitor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giám sát</tspan></text>
      <text x="662" y="336" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>orders out versus in,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lệnh ra so với lệnh vào,</tspan></text>
      <text x="662" y="352" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>loss so far</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lỗ đến lúc này</tspan></text>
      <line x1="671" x2="671" y1="140" y2="276" class="ln" />
      <polygon points="665,276 671,288 677,276" class="arr" />

      <rect x="278" y="290" width="250" height="74" rx="6" class="box bad" />
      <DiagramIcon name="stop" x={310} y={327} size={28} />
      <text x="338" y="318" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Stop button</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nút dừng</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="336" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>a person, or a rule</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một người, hoặc một quy tắc</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="352" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>that needs no model</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không cần mô hình</tspan></text>
      <line x1="606" x2="540" y1="327" y2="327" class="ln" />
      <polygon points="540,321 528,327 540,333" class="arr" />
      <line x1="503" x2="503" y1="290" y2="160" class="ln bad-l" />
      <polygon points="497,160 503,148 509,160" class="arr" />
      <text x="515" y="276" class="n red-t"><tspan data-lang-en>closes the gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đóng cổng</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="410" class="n"><tspan data-lang-en>The exchange band is a second gate you do not own: it bounds a price, never a volume.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên độ của sàn là cổng thứ hai bạn không sở hữu: nó chặn giá, không chặn khối lượng.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The checks are examples, with limits you pick. What matters is where the gate sits: after every agent, before every order.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các bước kiểm tra chỉ là ví dụ, hạn mức do bạn chọn. Điều quan trọng là vị trí của cổng: sau mọi agent, trước mọi lệnh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p22q { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p22q-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p22q svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .n { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .red-t { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .box.gate { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .box.bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .ln { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bad-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .arr { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .p22q figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
